      "title": "Planner-as-Router: Joint Plan-Time Model Routing for Cost-Efficient Multi-Agent Workflows",
      "topic": "agent",
      "language": [
        "zh",
        "en"
      ],
      "authors": [
        "Vivek Kumar Singh",
        "Preeti Priyam",
        "Gautam Bhowmick"
      ],
      "institution": null,
      "summary": {
        "zh": "Planner-as-Router (PaR) 通过将模型路由决策整合到任务规划阶段，解决了多智能体工作流中成本高企的问题。它通过全局视角分配不同能力的模型层级，避免了传统逐调用路由的错误累积问题，且无需额外训练数据。实验表明，PaR 在显著降低成本的同时保持了具有竞争力的准确性，为企业级 LLM 应用提供了一种高效的经济性解决方案。",
        "en": "- **Background**: Running LLM agents in production is expensive. Frontier models are accurate but can cost up to 25 times more per token than small models, a gap that compounds in multi-step workflows."
      },
